---
/**
 * 读者信 · 航空信封拆信组件（A2 斜插露角 · 方案一：正式来信栏 + 米白全屏信纸）
 * 放置于首页专栏区块下方。点击信封 → 全屏读信（Esc / ✕ / 点背景关闭）。
 * 信文严格按 Desktop/obsidian/写给读者的一封信。.md 原文顺序，仅做标题/加粗/引用/列表的视觉优化。
 * 信内二维码复用页脚 wechat-qr 弹层（不直接贴图）；暗号置于全文最底部。
 */
---

<div class="rdl-wrap">
  {/* ===== 第 1 层 · 背景插画（focus-traveller 湖山场景） ===== */}
  <div class="rdl-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  {/* ===== 第 2 层 · 半透明遮罩 ===== */}
  <div class="rdl-bg-ov" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  {/* ===== 第 3 层 · 顶层内容（引导栏 + 信封） ===== */}
  <div class="rdl-ct">
    {/* 引导栏 */}
    <div class="rdl-headbar">
      <div class="rdl-ic">✉</div>
      <h2 class="rdl-h2">《致读者的一封信》</h2>
      <p class="rdl-sub">关于免费资料、AI 时代的用法，以及怎么找到我</p>
    </div>

    {/* 信封 */}
    <div class="rdl-stage">
      <div class="rdl-scene" id="rdl-scene">
        <div class="rdl-env">
          <div class="rdl-face">
            <div class="rdl-back"></div>
            <div class="rdl-lpeek">
              <span class="rdl-lp-tag">✈ 致读者的一封信</span>
              <div class="rdl-lp-title">“我”读完，就让 <em>AI</em> 读。<br />把资源变成资产。</div>
              <span class="rdl-lp-hint">点 击 展 开 阅 读</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rdl-flap"></div>
            <div class="rdl-pocket"></div>
            <div class="rdl-wax">启</div>
            <div class="rdl-qinqi">亲启</div>
            <div class="rdl-addr"><em>TO · READER</em><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="rdl-via">VIA AIR MAIL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rdl-hint">— 点 击 拆 信 —</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{/* ===== 全屏读信 ===== */}
<div class="rdl-ov" id="rdl-ov" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="致读者的一封信">
  <div class="rdl-shade" id="rdl-shade"></div>
  <div class="rdl-sheet" id="rdl-sheet">
    <button class="rdl-close" id="rdl-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭">✕</button>
    <div class="rdl-sheet-top"><span>FROM · 像企业家一样写作</span><span>№ 001 · VIA AIR MAIL</span></div>
    <div class="rdl-paper" id="rdl-paper"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<template id="rdl-tpl">
  {/* 标题：新稿 H1，冒号后半做内部重音；H1 下的引句做开篇钩子 */}
  <h3 class="rdl-title">把资源变成资产：<em>每一个书籍，都给你「PDF + Markdown」双版本</em></h3>
  <p class="rdl-emph">「我」读完，就让 AI 读。</p>

  <p class="rdl-p">你好，我是「种一个梦」公众号的主理人，《闭环：在你睡觉时赚钱》等书，我写完了，但我更希望它不只是一本被"读完"的书，而是一套能被你<b>拿走、改造、复用</b>的资产。</p>
  <p class="rdl-p">你不是拥有阅读权。</p>

  <h4>一、你能拿到什么？</h4>
  <p class="rdl-p">网站上的每一个书籍，我都为你准备了两套版本：</p>
  <ul class="rdl-list">
    <li><b>精美 PDF 版</b>：排版精致，适合深度阅读、收藏保存、打印成册。</li>
    <li><b>本地 Markdown 文件包</b>：纯文本、无平台绑定，是 AI 时代真正属于你的<b>核心知识资产</b>。</li>
  </ul>

  <figure class="rdl-fig">
    <img src="/images/letter-kb-books.jpg" alt="知识库：《闭环》《选择改变命运》的 Markdown 与 PDF 文件" loading="lazy" />
    <figcaption>放进你的知识库，让 AI 随时调用它</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h4>二、拿到手怎么用？（三选一，马上见效）</h4>
  <p class="rdl-p"><b class="rdl-num">①</b><b>让 AI 替你读</b>。把 PDF 文件直接丢给豆包、元宝、ChatGPT——让它帮你提炼重点、压缩成一张知识地图、结合你的工作分析"哪些能直接用、怎么用"。或，放进你自己的阅读器（微信读书、kindle、平板）慢慢读。</p>
  <p class="rdl-p"><b class="rdl-num">②</b><b>构建你的专属知识库。</b>把整套 Markdown 文件放进 Obsidian 等「知识库」工具，用 Agent（workbuddy、Qclaw、Hermes…）去阅读、编辑、拆解、<b>二创</b>，把一本书拆成你的知识库、Prompt 提示词、自动化工作流，又或者任何你需要的生产力工具，甚至一个产品。</p>
  <p class="rdl-p">因为——<a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/82u-7l75Z04l7ohQzQTQLg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">文章即代码</a>。总之，没有限制，发挥你的想象力，你不只是拥有阅读权限。</p>
  <p class="rdl-p">不只是「读书」，还要「<a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/P3riaxxextfinvu-YBm8-g" target="_blank" rel="noopener">写书</a>」。我写完这篇文章，我希望这些内容不只是被你“读过”，而是希望它能真正被你拿走、重构、迭代、用起来，变成你自己的资产。</p>

  <figure class="rdl-fig">
    <img src="/images/letter-write-book.png" alt="混合笔记系统：纸质笔记本与手机数字笔记" loading="lazy" />
  </figure>

  <p class="rdl-p"><b class="rdl-num">③</b><b>打印成纸质版</b></p>
  <p class="rdl-p">《闭环》已做过排版与视觉优化，打印质感极佳，优先推荐这两本。</p>

  <h4>三、如何领取？（3 选 1，30 秒搞定）</h4>
  <div class="rdl-claim">
    <div class="rdl-claim-row">
      <div class="rdl-claim-txt">
        <b>方式一：加微信（最直接且高效）</b>
        <ul class="rdl-list rdl-dot">
          <li>微信号：<code>gusang211800</code>，或者点击<button type="button" class="rdl-qr-btn" id="rdl-qr-btn">二维码</button>扫二维码添加我的微信，回复「资料包」领取完整版资料。</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="rdl-ps">PS：专栏内容为付费内容，仅对付费读者开放。</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rdl-claim-row">
      <div class="rdl-claim-txt">
        <b>方式二：I 人极速通道（无需加好友）</b>
        <ul class="rdl-list rdl-dot">
          <li>公众号后台回复关键词即可领取：回复关键词——「闭环」｜「选择改变命运」｜「格雷厄姆文集」</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rdl-claim-row">
      <div class="rdl-claim-txt">
        <b>方式三：付费读者专属「专栏」内容</b>
        <ul class="rdl-list rdl-dot">
          <li>专栏内容为付费读者专属，凭文章<b>最底部</b>的专属暗号，添加微信领取。<b>暗号在哪里</b>？这个文章的最底部——<a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QnwuoIzN_dxPYM5W5hsWMA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">介绍信</a>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* 落款 */}
  <div class="rdl-sign">—— 写给你的，种一个梦</div>
</template>

<style is:global>
/* ===== 读者信（rdl- 前缀防冲突）· 放大版 ===== */
/* 三层结构（金句做法）：背景插画 → 半透明遮罩 → 顶层内容，均 absolute inset:0 叠放 */
.rdl-wrap{position:relative;width:calc(100% - 48px);max-width:1200px;margin:16px auto 0;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(28,25,23,.12);}
.rdl-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/images/letter-bg-focus.jpg') center 58% / cover no-repeat;}
.rdl-bg-ov{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(22,17,10,.44);}
.rdl-ct{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:54px 20px 64px;}
.rdl-headbar{text-align:center;padding:0 20px;}
.rdl-ic{font-size:26px;color:#ffd9a8;line-height:1;}
.rdl-h2{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:2.3rem;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 6px;color:#fff;
  text-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.25);}
.rdl-sub{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);}
.rdl-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding-top:130px;}
.rdl-hint{margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);letter-spacing:.3em;}

/* 信封 A2 · 放大 */
.rdl-env{position:relative;width:min(480px,88vw);aspect-ratio:410/252;padding:9px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#b8433a 0 16px,#f6efdd 16px 32px,#31608f 32px 48px,#f6efdd 48px 64px);
  box-shadow:0 26px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:transform .4s;}
.rdl-env:hover{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-.4deg);}
.rdl-face{position:absolute;inset:9px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8f2e4;}
.rdl-back{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:6px;background:#f3ecd9;}
.rdl-lpeek{position:absolute;left:13%;right:13%;top:-30%;bottom:20%;background:#fffdf7;border-radius:8px;z-index:2;
  box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.17);padding:26px 28px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;
  transform:rotate(-6deg);transition:transform .5s;}
.rdl-env:hover .rdl-lpeek{transform:rotate(-6deg) translateY(-10px);}
.rdl-lpeek::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;bottom:12px;height:1.5px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#ddd0b0 0 10px,transparent 10px 18px);}
.rdl-lp-tag{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.35em;color:#b8a37a;margin-bottom:14px;}
.rdl-lp-title{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;text-align:center;color:var(--color-text);}
.rdl-lp-title em{font-style:normal;color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-lp-hint{margin-top:16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#a8a29e;letter-spacing:.3em;animation:rdlFloat 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes rdlFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.6}50%{transform:translateY(3px);opacity:1}}
.rdl-flap{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:55%;background:#f9f3e3;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,50% 97%);
  transform-origin:top center;transform:rotateX(178deg);z-index:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 -2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.05));}
.rdl-pocket{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:6px;background:#f6f0e0;clip-path:polygon(0 0,50% 52%,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);z-index:3;}
.rdl-pocket::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.03),transparent 40%);clip-path:inherit;}
.rdl-via{position:absolute;right:6%;bottom:7%;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.28em;color:#b8433a;font-weight:600;z-index:4;}
.rdl-addr{position:absolute;left:9%;bottom:12%;width:32%;z-index:4;}
.rdl-addr em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;color:#a89873;letter-spacing:.25em;margin-bottom:7px;}
.rdl-addr i{display:block;height:2.5px;background:#ddd0b0;margin:10px 0;border-radius:2px;}
.rdl-wax{position:absolute;left:50%;top:52%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;z-index:4;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 30%,#f07a4b,#d94f2b 55%,#a83418);box-shadow:0 3px 9px rgba(0,0,0,.28),inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-serif);color:#fff7ef;font-size:15px;}
.rdl-qinqi{position:absolute;right:4%;top:-30%;z-index:3;background:#b8433a;color:#fff7ef;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:14px;
  padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;transform:rotate(8deg);letter-spacing:.2em;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.22);}

/* ===== 全屏读信（米白信纸垫） ===== */
.rdl-ov{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1200;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:4vh 16px;}
.rdl-ov.show{display:flex;}
.rdl-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6f1e6,#efe7d6);opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;}
.rdl-ov.in .rdl-shade{opacity:1;}
.rdl-sheet{position:relative;width:min(780px,94vw);max-height:92vh;overflow-y:auto;background:#fffdf7;border-radius:14px;
  padding:46px 48px 38px;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.16);opacity:0;transform:translateY(46px) scale(.97);
  transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),opacity .4s;}
.rdl-ov.in .rdl-sheet{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
.rdl-close{position:sticky;top:0;float:right;width:36px;height:36px;border:none;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(28,25,23,.06);
  color:#57534e;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;z-index:5;transition:background .2s,color .2s;}
.rdl-close:hover{background:rgba(245,80,0,.1);color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-sheet-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#b8a37a;
  border-bottom:1px solid #eee2c8;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:26px;}

/* ===== 信内排版（丙 · 极简优化版） ===== */
.rdl-title{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6;text-align:center;margin:0 0 26px;}
.rdl-title em{display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:2;margin:14px 0;}
.rdl-p b{color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:700;}
.rdl-num{color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:800;margin-right:4px;}
.rdl-list{list-style:none;margin:10px 0;padding:0;}
.rdl-list li{position:relative;padding-left:20px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.95;margin:7px 0;}
.rdl-list li::before{content:'·';position:absolute;left:4px;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:700;}
.rdl-list b{color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-tick li::before{content:'✓';font-size:12px;top:1px;color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-dot li{padding-left:16px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.85;margin:5px 0;}
.rdl-dot li::before{content:'·';left:2px;}
.rdl-paper h4{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 6px;padding-left:11px;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-flow{text-align:center;font-size:15.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:600;margin:16px 0;}
.rdl-emph{margin:18px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:rgba(245,80,0,.06);border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.9;}
.rdl-emph b{color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:700;}
.rdl-emph b:last-child{margin-left:.4em;}
.rdl-fig{margin:20px 0;}
.rdl-fig img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #ece2cc;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(28,25,23,.08);background:#fff;}
.rdl-fig figcaption{margin-top:9px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8378;letter-spacing:.04em;}
.rdl-claim{margin-top:14px;}
.rdl-claim-row{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;border:1px dashed #d9c9a8;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;background:#fffef9;margin-bottom:14px;}
.rdl-claim-txt{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.9;color:#57534e;}
.rdl-claim-txt>b:first-child{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:15px;color:var(--color-text);}
.rdl-claim-txt b{color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-claim-txt code{background:#f5f0e4;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;font-size:13.5px;}
.rdl-ps{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8378;line-height:1.8;}
.rdl-ps b{color:var(--color-accent);}
.rdl-code{margin-top:22px;text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;border:1px dashed rgba(245,80,0,.35);color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;width:fit-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
.rdl-code span{color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:12px;}
.rdl-sign{margin-top:18px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:14.5px;color:#57534e;}

.rdl-qr-btn{display:inline;border:none;background:none;padding:0;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;color:var(--color-accent);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;}
.rdl-qr-btn:hover{color:#c2410c;}

body.rdl-locked{overflow:hidden;}
/* 信打开时，页脚二维码弹层要浮在信纸之上（信 = 1200） */
body.rdl-locked .wechat-qr-overlay.wechat-qr-overlay{z-index:1400;}

@media(max-width:760px){
  .rdl-h2{font-size:1.8rem;}
  .rdl-stage{padding-top:150px;}
  .rdl-lp-title{font-size:18px;}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .rdl-ct{padding:40px 18px 48px;}
  .rdl-stage{padding-top:118px;}
  .rdl-scene{width:100%;max-width:480px;}
  .rdl-env{width:100%;}
  .rdl-h2{font-size:1.5rem;}
  .rdl-sub{font-size:13.5px;}
  .rdl-lpeek{left:8%;right:8%;padding:20px 16px 16px;}
  .rdl-lp-title{font-size:15px;}
  .rdl-lp-tag{font-size:11px;}
  .rdl-lp-hint{font-size:11.5px;}
  .rdl-sheet{padding:30px 20px 26px;}
  .rdl-title{font-size:1.4rem;}
  .rdl-claim-row{flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
}
</style>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var scene = document.getElementById('rdl-scene');
  var ov = document.getElementById('rdl-ov');
  var paper = document.getElementById('rdl-paper');
  if (!scene || !ov || !paper) return;
  paper.appendChild(document.getElementById('rdl-tpl').content.cloneNode(true));

  var qrBtn = document.getElementById('rdl-qr-btn');
  if (qrBtn) qrBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
    var t = document.getElementById('wechat-qr-trigger');
    if (t) t.click(); // 复用页脚二维码弹层
  });

  function open() {
    ov.classList.add('show');
    document.body.classList.add('rdl-locked');
    requestAnimationFrame(function () {
      requestAnimationFrame(function () { ov.classList.add('in'); });
    });
  }
  function close() {
    ov.classList.remove('in');
    setTimeout(function () {
      ov.classList.remove('show');
      document.body.classList.remove('rdl-locked');
    }, 320);
  }

  scene.addEventListener('click', open);
  document.getElementById('rdl-close').addEventListener('click', close);
  document.getElementById('rdl-shade').addEventListener('click', close);
  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
    if (e.key === 'Escape' && ov.classList.contains('show')) close();
  });
})();
</script>
